1
00:00:28,491 --> 00:00:36,914
The German sun is burning bright,
This campsite tent is boiling hot.

2
00:00:38,206 --> 00:00:46,845
Spooky flies in blinding light,
Shadows on my sleeping spot.

3
00:00:46,874 --> 00:00:51,327
A sissing whisper in my ear,
A heavy weight upon my bed.

4
00:00:51,462 --> 00:00:57,865
"She is so glad you are not here,
She's with a normal boy instead!"

5
00:01:08,827 --> 00:01:16,965
A coin phone hangs upon the wall,
Outside by the office door.

6
00:01:18,283 --> 00:01:28,013
But I am scared to make the call,
And break myself forevermore.

7
00:01:28,050 --> 00:01:32,333
I grab myself with shaking hands,
To push the demon out of sight.

8
00:01:32,599 --> 00:01:38,373
A desperate act in burning sands,
Then cold and ash in silent night.

9
00:01:56,496 --> 00:02:04,601
I wear a mask to play along,
We ride the bike and swim the lake.

10
00:02:05,686 --> 00:02:14,577
But everything I do feels wrong,
I fake a smile for family's sake.

11
00:02:14,744 --> 00:02:19,210
A sissing whisper in my ear,
A heavy weight upon my bed.

12
00:02:19,362 --> 00:02:24,994
"She is so glad you are not here,
She's with a normal boy instead!"

13
00:02:33,666 --> 00:02:38,516
Are you relieved that I am gone?
Did you find someone normal now?

14
00:02:38,597 --> 00:02:43,788
I trace your laugh until the dawn,
And bite the pillow, weeping low.

15
00:02:43,875 --> 00:02:48,570
I grab myself with shaking hands,
To push the demon out of sight.

16
00:02:48,597 --> 00:02:54,307
A desperate act in burning sands,
Then cold and ash in silent night.

17
00:03:40,908 --> 00:03:49,482
The empty void has grown its teeth,	
They bite me cruel and bite me deep.

18
00:03:50,387 --> 00:03:59,416
I'm hollowed out and cold beneath,
Just screaming in my lonely sleep.

19
00:03:59,461 --> 00:04:04,115
A sissing whisper in my ear,
A heavy weight upon my bed.

20
00:04:04,152 --> 00:04:09,212
"She is so glad you are not here,
She's with a normal boy instead!"

21
00:04:09,548 --> 00:04:14,058
Drowning in this burning pain,
A shell that breathes without a soul.

22
00:04:14,105 --> 00:04:19,077
Three weeks of searching in the rain,
To make this broken engine whole.

23
00:04:19,117 --> 00:04:23,728
I grab myself with shaking hands,
To push the demon out of sight.

24
00:04:23,764 --> 00:04:29,259
A desperate act in burning sands,
Then cold and ash in silent night.

